WEBVTT

00:13:26.037 --> 00:13:31.579
Wow. So you went from over 100 to four out
of 12 interested in at least learning

00:13:31.579 --> 00:13:36.079
more about you to 100 percent success
rate once you got an interview.

00:13:36.246 --> 00:13:37.996
Yeah, and that was it.

00:13:38.704 --> 00:13:42.746
Dallas found a proactive way to showcase
his skills specific to the field.

00:13:43.371 --> 00:13:45.037
Instead of going to the recruiters,

00:13:45.329 --> 00:13:48.246
he turned the tables and brought
the recruiters to him.

00:13:48.996 --> 00:13:51.787
This kind of initiative can help
you expand your network

00:13:51.787 --> 00:13:53.579
and access to new opportunities to.

00:13:54.537 --> 00:13:57.371
A few years ago, I got a cold
email from a web designer.

00:13:57.829 --> 00:14:01.037
She sent me a mock up of how she thought
my homepage should be redesigned.